{"_v":1,"id":"girl-from-the-north-country-2022","cs":81.55,"rc":11,"bd":{"positive":8,"mixed":2,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":89,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/girl-from-the-north-country-review-back-home-again-on-desolation-row-11583437370","q":"What Mr. McPherson does with Mr. Dylan’s songs is infallibly right."},{"cn":"Chris Jones","o":"Chicago Tribune","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.chicagotribune.com/2020/03/05/review-bob-dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-is-nothing-less-than-a-broadway-revelation/","d":"2020-03-05","q":"This show makes the case that his lyrics deserved that Nobel Prize in literature."},{"cn":"Marilyn Stasio","o":"Variety","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2020/legit/reviews/girl-from-the-north-country-review-bob-dylan-musical-broadway-1203525779/","d":"2020-03-05","q":"But Winningham puts so much heart into both songs that she can leave you trembling."},{"cn":"David Finkle","o":"New York Stage Review","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://nystagereview.com/2022/05/29/girl-from-the-north-country-bob-dylan-musical-remains-superb/","d":"2022-05-29","q":"It reopened April 29, 2022, confirming this reviewer’s belief that the property is the best musical — jukebox or no — of the past three years."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/page/world/ny/ny671.html","d":"2021-10-14","q":"The show is a gorgeous, moody meditation on hardship and hope that uses Dylan's songbook to create something that feels both timeless and utterly of the moment."},{"cn":"Tim Teeman","o":"The Daily Beast","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.thedailybeast.com/bob-dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-brilliantly-reborn-on-broadway/?via=twitter_page","q":"Everything in this exquisite Broadway transfer is in perfectly rendered unison."},{"cn":"Simon Saltzman","o":"CurtainUp","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.curtainup.com/girlfromthenorthcountrybway.html","q":"Now their melancholy lyricism and sublime melodies make me feel almost foolish for my failure to fully appreciate them earlier."},{"cn":"David Browne","o":"Rolling Stone","s":64,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.rollingstone.com/music/music-live-reviews/dylan-musical-girl-from-the-north-country-broadway-review-960576/","q":"It's as audacious, enlightening, and exasperating as the man himself."},{"cn":"Brian Scott Lipton","o":"Cititour","s":83,"b":"Rave","t":3,"u":"https://cititour.com/NYC_Broadway/Girl-From-the-North-Country/1026","q":"Their seemingly disparate sensibilities have come together to create one of the most haunting – and hauntingly beautiful -- musicals I've ever seen."},{"cn":"Brittany Crowell","o":"Front Row Center","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":3,"u":"https://thefrontrowcenter.com/2022/05/girl-from-the-north-country-3/","d":"2022-05-05","q":"It reads more as a concert and play mash-up with a few too many people on the stage and a deeply tried attempt at emotionally impacting the audience."},{"cn":"David Cote","o":"Theater News Online","s":31,"b":"Pan","t":3,"u":"https://theaternewsonline.com/NYTheaterReviews/DEPRESSINGDYLAN.cfm","q":"An American musical by people who hate musicals and don't know America."}],"au":{"score":69.24,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"ss":{"s":76,"c":701},"mz":{"s":61,"c":521,"sr":3},"th":{"s":52,"c":26}}},"hi":"/images/shows/girl-from-the-north-country-2022/hero.webp","ta":"111 W 44th St, New York, NY 10036","ca":[{"n":"Todd Almond","r":"Elias Burke"},{"n":"Jeannette Bayardelle","r":"Mrs. Neilsen"},{"n":"Matthew Frederick Harris","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Caitlin Houlahan","r":"Kate Draper"},{"n":"Robert Joy","r":"Dr. Walker"},{"n":"Marc Kudisch","r":"Mr. Burke"},{"n":"Luba Mason","r":"Mrs. Burke"},{"n":"Matt McGrath","r":"Reverend Marlowe"},{"n":"Tom Nelis","r":"Mr. Perry"},{"n":"Colton Ryan","r":"Gene Laine"},{"n":"Jay O. Sanders","r":"Nick Laine"},{"n":"John Schiappa","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Austin Scott","r":"Joe Scott"},{"n":"Kimber Elayne Sprawl","r":"Marianne Laine"},{"n":"Rachel Stern","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Chelsea Lee Williams","r":"Ensemble"},{"n":"Mare Winningham","r":"Elizabeth Laine"}]}